=== Which mode reproduces EGFR's signature in CGGA? ===
  Observed for EGFR: variance share 0.106 (TCGA) -> 0.024-0.045 (CGGA),
  a ratio of 0.23-0.42, with WITHIN-stratum SD essentially unchanged.

mode            dose  var ratio     AUC detect
permute         0.50      0.283          0.728   <-- matches EGFR
compress        0.50      0.393          0.730   <-- matches EGFR
noise           2.00      0.231          0.779   <-- matches EGFR
compress        0.25      0.138          0.848
noise           1.00      0.521          0.653
floor           0.75      0.529          0.599
permute         0.75      0.101          0.858
permute         0.25      0.580          0.630
compress        0.75      0.702          0.639
floor           0.50      0.797          0.528
noise           0.50      0.803          0.567
contaminate     0.50      0.844          0.667
contaminate     0.25      0.939          0.543
contaminate     0.75      0.961          0.734
floor           0.25      0.977          0.498

  Closest match: permute at dose 0.50 (variance ratio 0.283), detected with AUC 0.728.
  This is the number that says whether the gate could have caught the EGFR
  failure -- as opposed to catching permutation, which is not what EGFR shows.

